text:
*Welcome to all the new fans*  😍  This is Blackpink's second MV from the Born Pink album. 
         *BLACKPINK are the first music artists to reach 95M Youtube subscribers!*
In this MV,  all the throwback references to past MVs!
*Lisa* with black hair/bangs, Playing With Fire bridge, Boombayah bag-pile and Ddu-Ddu Ddu-Ddu sword; 
*Jennie* with long black hair, Ddu-Ddu Ddu-Ddu mirror tank and Playing With Fire bath;
*Jisoo* with very long black hair, Ddu-Ddu Ddu-Ddu pink umbrella and paparazzi cameras; 
*Rosé* with long blond hair, on the Whistle globe and Ddu-Ddu Ddu-Ddu rose swing
